body:
@Jack-023 
> Changing the stretch mode to viewport does fix the issue but I am not exactly sure what the other consequences will be.

Like I said, it completely messed up the smoothness of our camera during cutscenes of our game, so there definitely is consequences to switching to `viewport` if you have developed a game entirely with `canvas_items` scaling in mind. I am personally just waiting for a fix. 

> edit: side note
@Professor-Moof that final screenshot of your project settings is heinous. I thought I had a dead pixel for a second.

this is what happens when you use W11's built in screenshot tool and accidentally use the marker tool because I accidentally clicked slightly on the photo before saving it. It is heinous, I agree. I apologize for these grave misdeeds.
